Package: reims-manager
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, usbutils, acl, policykit-1
Description: desktop manager for Reims virtual machines
 Reims Manager provides a native GTK interface for viewing and operating
 Reims vGPU virtual machines, including selected USB passthrough operations.
 Reims vGPU must be installed separately.
